langen:dwave_eng 0, "voice\99\shopma4005.ogg":^Tiens donc, Maria !^@:dwave_eng 0, "voice\99\shopma4006.ogg":^ Bonsoir, ma grande !^@:dwave_eng 0, "voice\99\shopma4007.ogg":^ Ta maman rentre encore tard, ce soir... ?^@

